    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind Flowers</strong> is a <strong>narrative-driven psychological simulation</strong> with pixel art aesthetics, immersing you in a hauntingly beautiful dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>psychologist</strong>, you run a clinic in a decaying city, diagnosing patients with mysterious conditions named after flowers. Each case takes you deep into their <strong>memories</strong>, where you experience their past, uncover their struggles, and make life-changing decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But be careful!</strong> A wrong diagnosis may lead them to <strong>irreversible consequences</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep and emotional storyline</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted pixel art visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark, immersive atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-driven gameplay that shapes the world around you</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind Flowers</strong> is not just a game; it's an exploration of the human mind and the fragility of emotions. <strong>Are you ready to uncover the truth?</strong> \ud83c\udf38</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind Flowers</strong> is a <strong>narrative-driven psychological simulation</strong> with pixel art aesthetics, immersing you in a hauntingly beautiful dystopian world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>psychologist</strong>, you run a clinic in a decaying city, diagnosing patients with mysterious conditions named after flowers. Each case takes you deep into their <strong>memories</strong>, where you experience their past, uncover their struggles, and make life-changing decisions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But be careful!</strong> A wrong diagnosis may lead them to <strong>irreversible consequences</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A deep and emotional storyline</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Handcrafted pixel art visuals</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A dark, immersive atmosphere</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decision-driven gameplay that shapes the world around you</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mind Flowers</strong> is not just a game; it's an exploration of the human mind and the fragility of emotions. <strong>Are you ready to uncover the truth?</strong> \ud83c\udf38</p>",
